{{also|home-sickness}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|home-sickness}}

===Etymology===
{{calque|en|de|Heimweh|t=homesickness|lit=home-woe}}, equivalent to {{af|en|home|sickness}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# The characteristic of being [[homesick]]; a strong, sad [[feeling]] of [[miss]]ing one's [[home]] (and often left-behind loved ones, such as [[family]] and [[friend]]s) when physically away.

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|homesick}} (back-formation)

